-- whether two particles of species s may share one vertex with coupled spin tJ: exchanging them must give
-- the species' sign (exchange-sign); exchanging two particles on one vertex leaves the place as it was, so
-- the spins carry the whole sign. This is Pauli's exclusion read on the network.
shared-vertex-allows : Species → Nat → Bool
shared-vertex-allows s tJ = bit-eq (spin-pair-odd (sp-spin2 s) tJ) (sp-fermion s)
